# (build 111a) The AUDIO page's OVERSAMPLE: the rate Q's PM voices run at,
# 1X, 2X or 4X the output's (docs/audio.md, "Build 111a"). 4X, the default,
# puts nothing folded back in the audible band; 1X has the chip's images --
# its crunch on the bright effects. It is Q's: route_probe is built without Q
# and the chip plays, so the line under it says Q ONLY, and the chip sounds
# the same whatever it is (the title's theme plays on through every change).
# Left and right step and stop at the ends; C steps on and goes round (4X to
# 1X). The route reads its own settings.json, never the player's.
start new
sound render on
wait screen title
wait ticks 420
press esc
expect escape-menu open
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press c
press down
press down
press down
press down
expect audio oversample 4X / Q ONLY
press right
expect audio oversample 4X / Q ONLY
press left
expect audio oversample 2X / Q ONLY
press left
expect audio oversample 1X / Q ONLY
press left
expect audio oversample 1X / Q ONLY
wait ticks 10
shot page_oversample_1x
expect sound playing
press c
expect audio oversample 2X / Q ONLY
press c
expect audio oversample 4X / Q ONLY
press c
expect audio oversample 1X / Q ONLY
press right
press right
expect audio oversample 4X / Q ONLY
wait ticks 12
expect sound playing
press b
press b
expect escape-menu closed
